{%- doc -%}
  VECTRA Solutions / How We Help — Version 2 final CMS copy (hardcoded).
{%- enddoc -%}

{% render 'vectra-assets' %}
{% liquid
  assign img_mark = 'vectra-6fbd7c62e521082467b9d6192e09d91235f198a5.png' | asset_url
  assign img_badge = 'vectra-58b46df4a1e51a5a12917bf1285632e15c205635.png' | asset_url
  assign img_collage_1 = 'vectra-514da1e5ddd8e93543da62a9818e4183b5547b3a.png' | asset_url
  assign img_collage_2 = 'vectra-ae8b362b8368e8b200e58c921e1c7c274608a975.png' | asset_url
  assign img_collage_3 = 'vectra-add817f67c59297c528c5d57486a2794644fb47c.png' | asset_url
  assign img_collage_4 = 'vectra-78626510a1ed0aa2ddc4170280cbb69d727b4968.png' | asset_url
  assign img_leaf = 'vectra-7e32b8cb91105f95e3244070f5f535fb9ce04c02.svg' | asset_url
  assign img_svc = 'vectra-fba768472f693dc9d17736644f117390ddfce96f.png' | asset_url
  assign img_arrow = 'vectra-33469c114cd0dac188b171519c338a0fcdfa79a7.svg' | asset_url
  assign why_page = pages['why-partner-with-us'].url | default: '/pages/why-partner-with-us'
%}
{% capture why_href %}{% render 'vectra-preview-href', url: why_page, view: 'why-partner' %}{% endcapture %}
{% assign why_href = why_href | strip %}

{% case module %}
  {% when 'hero' %}
{% render 'vectra-seo', page_key: 'solutions' %}
{% unless block.settings.hide_section %}
<section
  class="vsol-hero vsol-hero--align-center"
  aria-label="How We Help"
  style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {% render 'vectra-image', image: block.settings.watermark, fallback: img_mark, alt: '', class: 'vsol-hero__icon', width: 901, height: 909, image_width: 900 %}
  <div class="vsol-hero__inner" data-vh-reveal="up">
    <p class="vsol-hero__kicker">HOW VECTRA HELPS BUSINESSES</p>
    <h1>Integrated Solutions for Operations That Need to Keep Performing</h1>
    <div class="vsol-hero__lead">
      <p>When operational pressure, supplier issues, changing requirements, weak controls, or capability gaps start getting in the way of performance, VECTRA International helps bring the right pieces together.</p>
      <p>We work with SMBs, enterprises, and value-chain partners to strengthen how the business operates, responds, and grows.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="vsol-hero__aeo">How VECTRA helps businesses is straightforward: we start with the outcome that needs to improve, then bring together the right solutions, specialist services, expertise, technology, and capability to make it happen. From context and design through implementation and measurement, we stay focused on stronger control, resilience, performance, and lasting capability.</p>
    <div class="vsol-hero__actions">
      <a class="vh-btn vh-btn--green" href="#solutions">See Our Solutions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endunless %}

  {% when 'intro' %}
{% unless block.settings.hide_section %}
<section class="vsol-intro" style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="vsol-intro__grid">
    <div class="vsol-collage">
      {% render 'vectra-image', image: block.settings.image_1, fallback: img_collage_1, alt: 'Teams reviewing operational dashboards', class: 'vsol-collage__a', width: 246, height: 246, image_width: 500 %}
      {% render 'vectra-image', image: block.settings.image_2, fallback: img_collage_2, alt: 'Connected operations across landscapes', class: 'vsol-collage__b', width: 314, height: 314, image_width: 640 %}
      {% render 'vectra-image', image: block.settings.image_3, fallback: img_collage_3, alt: 'ESG reporting in practice', class: 'vsol-collage__c', width: 314, height: 314, image_width: 640 %}
      {% render 'vectra-image', image: block.settings.image_4, fallback: img_collage_4, alt: 'Collaborative planning around sustainability', class: 'vsol-collage__d', width: 246, height: 246, image_width: 500 %}
      {% render 'vectra-image', image: block.settings.badge, fallback: img_badge, alt: 'Enabling Positive Business Impact', class: 'vsol-collage__badge', width: 143, height: 143, image_width: 300 %}
    </div>
    <div class="vsol-intro__copy" data-vh-reveal="right">
      <p class="vsol-kicker">OUR ECOSYSTEM OF SOLUTIONS</p>
      <h2>Design. Govern. Execute.</h2>
      <p>Most business problems do not stay inside one department.</p>
      <p>A supplier issue may become an operational problem. A regulatory requirement may expose a process gap. A new system may fail because the people using it are not ready.</p>
      <p>VECTRA brings together human expertise, specialist partners, AI-enabled intelligence, and practical support around what the business needs to achieve.</p>
      <p>Whatever the mix, VECTRA works as an <a href="{{ why_href }}">operational resilience partner</a> to keep the response coordinated as conditions change.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endunless %}

  {% when 'ecosystem' %}
{% unless block.settings.hide_section %}
<section class="vsol-eco" id="solutions" data-vsol-eco style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="vsol-eco__wrap">
    <div class="vsol-eco__custom" data-vh-reveal>
      <h3>Customized Solutions Built Around Your Business Needs</h3>
      <p>When the issue crosses several areas, we curate the right combination of expertise, Services, technology, and implementation support rather than forcing the work into a standard package.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="vsol-custom-card" href="#get-in-touch">
      <span>Talk to an Expert</span>
      <span class="vsol-custom-card__plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <div class="vsol-eco__cols">
      <div class="vsol-eco__col">
        <article class="vsol-card" data-vsol-card>
          <button class="vsol-card__hit" type="button" aria-expanded="false" onclick="window.vsolToggleCard && window.vsolToggleCard(this)">
            <span class="vsol-card__title">Operational Resilience</span>
            <span class="vsol-card__num">01</span>
          </button>
          <div class="vsol-card__panel">
            <img src="{{ img_collage_4 }}" alt="Operational resilience in practice">
            <div>
              <p>Strengthen operational control, business continuity, and response so critical work keeps moving when conditions change.</p>
              <a class="vsol-card__cta" href="#get-in-touch">Explore Operational Resilience</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="vsol-card" data-vsol-card>
          <button class="vsol-card__hit" type="button" aria-expanded="false" onclick="window.vsolToggleCard && window.vsolToggleCard(this)">
            <span class="vsol-card__title">Value Chain Resilience &amp; Improvement</span>
            <span class="vsol-card__num">02</span>
          </button>
          <div class="vsol-card__panel">
            <img src="{{ img_collage_4 }}" alt="Value chain resilience">
            <div>
              <p>See where supplier and value-chain risk is building, focus attention where it matters most, and turn findings into stronger supplier performance.</p>
              <a class="vsol-card__cta" href="#get-in-touch">Explore Value Chain Resilience &amp; Improvement</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="vsol-card" data-vsol-card>
          <button class="vsol-card__hit" type="button" aria-expanded="false" onclick="window.vsolToggleCard && window.vsolToggleCard(this)">
            <span class="vsol-card__title">Responsible Business Performance</span>
            <span class="vsol-card__num">03</span>
          </button>
          <div class="vsol-card__panel">
            <img src="{{ img_collage_4 }}" alt="Responsible business performance">
            <div>
              <p>Turn responsible-business and ESG requirements into clearer decisions, credible evidence, and stronger business performance.</p>
              <a class="vsol-card__cta" href="#get-in-touch">Explore Responsible Business Performance</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="vsol-eco__col">
        <article class="vsol-card" data-vsol-card>
          <button class="vsol-card__hit" type="button" aria-expanded="false" onclick="window.vsolToggleCard && window.vsolToggleCard(this)">
            <span class="vsol-card__title">Governance &amp; Regulatory Readiness</span>
            <span class="vsol-card__num">04</span>
          </button>
          <div class="vsol-card__panel">
            <img src="{{ img_collage_4 }}" alt="Governance and regulatory readiness">
            <div>
              <p>Translate changing requirements into clear ownership, workable controls, and evidence your teams can stand behind.</p>
              <a class="vsol-card__cta" href="#get-in-touch">Explore Governance &amp; Regulatory Readiness</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="vsol-card" data-vsol-card>
          <button class="vsol-card__hit" type="button" aria-expanded="false" onclick="window.vsolToggleCard && window.vsolToggleCard(this)">
            <span class="vsol-card__title">Capability Building at Scale</span>
            <span class="vsol-card__num">05</span>
          </button>
          <div class="vsol-card__panel">
            <img src="{{ img_collage_4 }}" alt="Capability building at scale">
            <div>
              <p>Give teams and suppliers the practical knowledge, confidence, and support they need to apply change consistently across the organization and value chain.</p>
              <a class="vsol-card__cta" href="#get-in-touch">Explore Capability Building at Scale</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endunless %}

  {% when 'outcomes' %}
{% unless block.settings.hide_section %}
<section class="vsol-out" style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <canvas class="vsol-out__grid" data-vsol-cell-grid aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="vsol-out__inner">
    <p class="vsol-kicker vsol-kicker--center" data-vh-reveal>WHAT STRONGER PERFORMANCE LOOKS LIKE</p>
    <h2 data-vh-reveal>From Complexity to Clearer, More Resilient Performance</h2>
    <p class="vsol-out__lead" data-vh-reveal>The real test of a solution is not how good the recommendation sounds.</p>
    <p class="vsol-out__lead" data-vh-reveal>It is whether the business becomes easier to control, better prepared to respond, and more capable of sustaining progress.</p>
    <div class="vsol-out__cards">
      <article class="vsol-glass" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <img src="{{ img_leaf }}" alt="">
        <h3>Operational Control</h3>
        <p>Priorities, responsibilities, owners, and next steps become clearer across the work.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-glass" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <img src="{{ img_leaf }}" alt="">
        <h3>Stronger Resilience</h3>
        <p>Teams, suppliers, and systems are better prepared to adapt and keep critical performance moving when conditions change.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-glass" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <img src="{{ img_leaf }}" alt="">
        <h3>Measurable Progress</h3>
        <p>Leaders have evidence that shows what has changed, what still needs attention, and where action should go next.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-glass" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <img src="{{ img_leaf }}" alt="">
        <h3>Lasting Capability</h3>
        <p>People build the knowledge and confidence to keep stronger ways of working in place after the immediate engagement ends.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endunless %}

  {% when 'services' %}
{% unless block.settings.hide_section %}
<section class="vsol-svc" id="services" style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="vsol-svc__head" data-vh-reveal>
    <p class="vsol-kicker vsol-kicker--center">OUR ECOSYSTEM OF SERVICES</p>
    <h2>Every Engagement Starts With the Business Outcome</h2>
    <p>We do not begin by asking which Service you want to avail.</p>
    <p>We begin by understanding the issue, the decision that needs to be made, who owns it, and what meaningful progress should look like.</p>
    <p>Then we bring in the Service expertise the work requires.</p>
    <p>Sometimes one service is enough. Sometimes several need to work together around the same priorities, owners, and next actions.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="vsol-svc__grid">
    <article class="vsol-svc-card" data-vh-reveal>
      <img src="{{ img_svc }}" alt="">
      <span class="vsol-svc-card__num">01</span>
      <div class="vsol-svc-card__body">
        <h3>Pre &amp; Post Audit Assistance</h3>
        <p>Prepare more confidently before an audit and keep progress moving after it. VECTRA helps teams understand readiness gaps, organize the evidence they need, respond to findings, and turn corrective actions into clear responsibilities and follow-through.</p>
        <a href="#get-in-touch">Explore Pre &amp; Post Audit Assistance</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="vsol-svc-card" data-vh-reveal>
      <img src="{{ img_svc }}" alt="">
      <span class="vsol-svc-card__num">02</span>
      <div class="vsol-svc-card__body">
        <h3>Compliance, Risk, &amp; Due Diligence</h3>
        <p>See where risk sits, understand what deserves attention, and make better-informed decisions about what happens next. VECTRA helps organizations assess compliance and due diligence needs, strengthen visibility across suppliers and operations, and turn risk information into practical action.</p>
        <a href="#get-in-touch">Explore Compliance, Risk, &amp; Due Diligence</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="vsol-svc-card" data-vh-reveal>
      <img src="{{ img_svc }}" alt="">
      <span class="vsol-svc-card__num">03</span>
      <div class="vsol-svc-card__body">
        <h3>Trainings</h3>
        <p>Give people the knowledge and confidence to put requirements, processes, and better ways of working into practice. VECTRA training connects learning with real business needs so teams and partners understand not only what is expected, but how to apply it in their day-to-day responsibilities.</p>
        <a href="#get-in-touch">Explore Trainings</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="vsol-svc-card" data-vh-reveal>
      <img src="{{ img_svc }}" alt="">
      <span class="vsol-svc-card__num">04</span>
      <div class="vsol-svc-card__body">
        <h3>Reporting</h3>
        <p>Turn scattered information into reporting that people can understand, use, and stand behind. VECTRA helps bring information, ownership, evidence, and review processes together so reporting becomes clearer, more consistent, and more useful for the decisions it needs to support.</p>
        <a href="#get-in-touch">Explore Reporting</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="vsol-svc-card" data-vh-reveal>
      <img src="{{ img_svc }}" alt="">
      <span class="vsol-svc-card__num">05</span>
      <div class="vsol-svc-card__body">
        <h3>Factory, Farm &amp; Mine Performance Improvement</h3>
        <p>Help operations perform better where day-to-day activity actually happens. VECTRA works with factories, farms, and mines to identify recurring performance issues, strengthen processes and responsibilities, and help teams put practical improvements into place and sustain them.</p>
        <a href="#get-in-touch">Explore Factory, Farm &amp; Mine Performance Improvement</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="vsol-svc-card" data-vh-reveal>
      <img src="{{ img_svc }}" alt="">
      <span class="vsol-svc-card__num">06</span>
      <div class="vsol-svc-card__body">
        <h3>Independent Quality Assurance</h3>
        <p>Bring an independent view to the quality, evidence, and processes behind important decisions and outcomes. VECTRA helps organizations verify whether expectations are being met, identify where greater confidence is needed, and strengthen the consistency and reliability of what is being delivered.</p>
        <a href="#get-in-touch">Explore Independent Quality Assurance</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
{% endunless %}

  {% when 'process' %}
{% unless block.settings.hide_section %}
<section class="vsol-process" id="how-we-partner" style="{% render 'vectra-block-style', settings: block.settings %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="vsol-process__inner">
    <canvas class="vsol-process__grid" data-vsol-cell-grid aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <p class="vsol-kicker vsol-kicker--center" data-vh-reveal>HOW WE PARTNER</p>
    <h2 data-vh-reveal>We Stay With the Work</h2>
    <p class="vsol-process__lead" data-vh-reveal>We work alongside your team from the first conversation through implementation, ongoing support, and continuous improvement.</p>
    <p class="vsol-process__lead" data-vh-reveal>VECTRA specialists work with the people closest to your operations. Human judgment guides the work, while AI-enabled, platform-agnostic technology helps speed up analysis, monitoring, and delivery.</p>
    <p class="vsol-process__lead" data-vh-reveal>We shape the approach around your systems, priorities, and capacity, and adapt it as requirements, operations, and business goals change.</p>
    <p class="vsol-process__pillars" data-vh-reveal>SHARED GOALS · JOINT OWNERSHIP · CLEAR COMMUNICATION · PRACTICAL IMPLEMENTATION · ONGOING SUPPORT</p>
    <div class="vsol-process__cards vsol-process__cards--cycle">
      <article class="vsol-step" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Concept</h3>
        <p>Clarify the challenge, desired result, and wider business context.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-step" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Consult</h3>
        <p>Understand the current position, risks, requirements, evidence, and priorities with the people closest to the work.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-step" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Design</h3>
        <p>Co-design the response, including practical controls, ownership, roadmap, capability, and the right technology for the context.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-step vsol-step--impl" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Service</h3>
        <p>Work alongside client teams to implement, build capability, verify progress, and resolve issues.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-step" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <span>05</span>
        <h3>Expand / Enhance</h3>
        <p>Extend what works, strengthen weak points, and scale where it adds value.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-step" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <span>06</span>
        <h3>Maintain</h3>
        <p>Reinforce governance, evidence, ownership, and internal capability so progress holds.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="vsol-step" data-vh-reveal="down">
        <span>07</span>
        <h3>Repeat</h3>
        <p>Revisit the cycle as requirements, operations, risks, and business priorities change.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endunless %}

{% endcase %}
